          "commentary_zh": "無門曰：參禪須透祖師關，妙悟要窮心路絕。祖關不透，心路不絕，盡是依草附木精靈。且道：如何是祖師關？只這一個「無」字，乃宗門一關也。遂目之曰「禪宗無門關」。",
          "commentary_pinyin": "Wúmén yuē: Cān chán xū tòu zǔshī guān, miào wù yào qióng xīn lù jué. Zǔ guān bù tòu, xīn lù bù jué, jìn shì yī cǎo fù mù jīnglíng. Qiě dào: Rú hé shì zǔshī guān? Zhǐ zhè yī gè 'Wú' zì, nǎi zōng mén yī guān yě. Suì mù zhī yuē 'Chánzōng Wúmén Guān'.",
          "commentary_en": "Wumen says: To practice Chan, you must pass through the barrier of the patriarchs; to achieve subtle realization, you must exhaust the pathways of the delusive mind. If you do not pass the patriarchal barrier and do not cut off mental pathways, you are like ghosts clinging to weeds and trees. Tell me: What is the patriarchal barrier? It is simply this single word 'Wu'—the premier barrier of the ancestral school.",
          "verse_zh": "狗子佛性，全提正令。纔涉有無，喪身失命。",
          "verse_pinyin": "Gǒuzi fóxìng, quán tí zhèng lìng. Cái shè yǒu wú, sàng shēn shī mìng.",
          "verse_en": "The dog, the Buddha-nature; / The official proclamation is fully displayed. / The moment you enter 'has' or 'has not', / You lose your body and forfeit your life!"
